#!/usr/bin/env node
/**
 * Store relocation, stage 2: McAllen, TX -> Castle Rock, CO (November 2026).
 *
 * The pages under app/ were generated by scripts/convert.mjs from the Brownsville clone and relocated to McAllen by
 * scripts/relocate.mjs (stage 1, kept as it was). This script rewrites every McAllen-specific value — city, state,
 * street address, ZIP, phone, e-mail, social links, map links, hours, time zone, live domain, the McAllen storefront /
 * team / hero photos and their alt texts, the brand-logo alt texts, the regional copy — to the Castle Rock store, in
 * the generated pages (page markup AND the Nuxt hydration payload, whose strings carry a second encoding), the
 * hand-written files (components/, lib/, overrides/ templates, public/*.js), vercel.json and package.json, so one
 * mapping is the single source of truth. lib/location.ts carries the same values for the React components: keep both
 * in sync.
 *
 *   node scripts/relocate-castle-rock.mjs            # rewrite in place (idempotent)
 *   node scripts/relocate-castle-rock.mjs --check    # only report leftovers, change nothing
 *
 * What this script does NOT invent: no reviews, ratings, staff names, offers, prices, drive times, coordinates or
 * legal entity name. The McAllen reviews, the Google reviews badge, the service-area pages, the blog posts and the
 * Spanish site are removed by hand (see the README, "Castle Rock clone").
 */
